Use the native 64-bit off_t functions instead of Linux suffixed aliases.

Compile-only cross checks falsely report pread64 and lseek64, which the
FreeBSD SDK does not declare. Native pread and lseek already use 64-bit
offsets; select Poppler's existing portable branches.

Upstream: PS5-only; corrects compile-only function probes.

